# Docker resolves .dockerignore beside the CONTEXT root, not beside the
# Dockerfile, and nox-build/linux/Dockerfile takes the repository root as its
# context so it can COPY the tree it builds from.
#
# Keep this list minimal. Nothing CMake reads may be excluded: the root
# CMakeLists.txt calls add_subdirectory(dist) unconditionally — unlike
# add_subdirectory(test), which sits inside if (TESTING) — and
# dist/unix/CMakeLists.txt installs man pages from ${PROJECT_SOURCE_DIR}/doc/.
# Excluding dist or doc fails the build at configure with "add_subdirectory
# given source 'dist' which is not an existing directory", after the image has
# already spent the apt and libtorrent layers.
.git
nox-build/tests
